//// The `onze-assets` package — module-tree root.
////
//// The asset pipeline — CSS modules, the stylesheet, `public/`,
//// `Image` and fonts, under one static prefix.
////
//// A skeleton created by front 95 (`specs/1.0.10-beta/06-onze/modules.md`
//// § The cut): an empty `pub` surface and one inline test, so the member is a
//// row of `zig build test-libs` from the first commit. Owner: front 69 (root) · 51 · 52.

test "onze-assets: the member compiles and runs on its rows" {
    assert "onze-assets".length() == 11;
}
